		<title>ONS subnational data conference 2024: open data &#038; code</title>
		<link>https://www.danolner.net/2024/11/ons-subnational-data-conference-2024-open-data-code</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[dan]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 13 Nov 2024 13:31:35 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Uncategorized]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.danolner.net/?p=1235</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[These slides for the ONS subnational data conference talk about the huge value and power of ONS data for the UK: how it can help us understand where we’ve come from and where we are now – and so help us work out we want to go. The data and code for everything-ONS-data in the &#8230; <img src="https://stats.webarch4.co.uk/piwik.php?idsite=13&amp;rec=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.danolner.net%2F2024%2F11%2Fons-subnational-data-conference-2024-open-data-code&amp;action_name=ONS%20subnational%20data%20conference%202024%3A%20open%20data%20%26%23038%3B%20code&amp;urlref=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.danolner.net%2Ffeed" style="border:0;width:0;height:0" width="0" height="0" alt="" />]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/6sgk49k3bf9cw0u40hkdb/PDF_DanOlner_ONS_subnational_14_11_24_FINAL.pdf?rlkey=9dmk50bh0z03vrfcnu0l8hjgo&amp;dl=1">These slides</a> for the <a href="https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/subnational-data-conference-supporting-local-decision-making-tickets-1042576082127">ONS subnational data conference</a> talk about the <strong>huge value and power of ONS data</strong> for the UK: how it can help us understand where we’ve come from and where we are now – and so help us work out we want to go.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The data and code for everything-ONS-data in the presentation is available <a href="https://danolner.github.io/posts/ons_subnational_data_conf/">over on the github blog</a> (along with links to everything else mentioned in the slides). As I say there, it&#8217;s in various stages of accessibility presently &#8211; some walkthroughs, some raw code. I want to work on improving access and useability as I talk to people about using this and other data for regional policy work.</p>
<img decoding="async" src="https://stats.webarch4.co.uk/piwik.php?idsite=13&amp;rec=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.danolner.net%2F2024%2F11%2Fons-subnational-data-conference-2024-open-data-code&amp;action_name=ONS%20subnational%20data%20conference%202024%3A%20open%20data%20%26%23038%3B%20code&amp;urlref=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.danolner.net%2Ffeed" style="border:0;width:0;height:0" width="0" height="0" alt="" />]]></content:encoded>
					
		
		
